ACP reaches 93.5 percent accuracy, within 0.2 points of Always Deliberate (93.7 percent) and 1.2 points of Fixed MLP (94.7 percent), while deliberating on 67.2 percent of inputs. Its routing accuracy is 98.7 percent. Always Fast falls to 37.0 percent overall and 26.4 percent on Hard inputs, where ACP reaches 86.3 percent.

The central result is the routing gradient. ACP deliberates on a small fraction of easy inputs, and on nearly all medium and hard inputs. This is the adaptive behavior the architecture is designed to produce.

